During the training and evaluation, we use the similar prompt template as the implementation of Wang et al. (2022),2525 25 https://github.com/yizhongw/Tk-Instruct where we concatenate the task instruction and input together and ask the model to produce the output for this instance. To be specific, we use the following prompt: “### Input:
{Input Text}

.### Instruction:{Task Instruction}

### Output:”. We fix this prompt for all the methods in our experiments (including our Muffin and all the baselines).
